<title>CHINA: FAIRWOOD YEAR NET LOSS HK$122.83 MLN.</title>
<headline>FAIRWOOD YEAR NET LOSS HK$122.83 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   20.0 loss   vs 17.0 loss (see note)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	   vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  42.31 loss  vs 0.89 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    122.83 loss vs 88.21 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,286.38    vs 1,282.47</p>
<p>    Company name		 Fairwood Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 24-26</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Fairwood is a fast food chain.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss mainly on provision against fixed assets of restaurants to be closed and on disposal of fixed assets on closure of restaurants.</p>
<p>Comparative loss per share has been adjusted to allow for the rights issue during the year.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
